        "type": "prompt",
        "label": "Brief",
        "text": "Two short vertical ads for the adidas GameCourt 2 tennis shoe — white mesh upper, dark purple heel and laces, gold adidas logo on the tongue, grey three stripes, on a blue hard court. FILM ONE is a 10 second unboxing: the box opens, the shoe comes out, first close look. FILM TWO is 20 seconds of actually wearing and testing them on court: lacing up, a hard lateral cut, a sprint to the net. Same person, same hands, same shoe throughout both films."
      }
